{"entity": "Spironolactone", "type": "artifact", "description": "A potassium-sparing diuretic medication used in low doses alongside ACE inhibitors for therapeutic benefit in heart failure.<SEP>A mineralocorticoid receptor antagonist used as a heart failure medicine and potassium-sparing diuretic."}
