{"entity": "Type 2 Diabetes", "type": "concept", "description": "Type 2 Diabetes is a metabolic disorder characterized by high blood sugar and insulin resistance, evaluated in clinical trials for ADMELOG.<SEP>A metabolic disorder serving as an inclusion criterion for patients in the VA NEPHRON trial.<SEP>A metabolic disorder characterized by high blood glucose levels, for which insulin resistance is a key feature.<SEP>A metabolic condition characterized by insulin resistance combined with progressive beta-cell dysfunction, treated through a stepwise approach.<SEP>A metabolic disorder for which metformin serves as a primary first-line treatment."}
